{"nodes": [{"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame02201__1__frame", "label": "Frame 02201 (copy 1) - Colour Overhead View from Gas Camera (2022-02-23 11:02:07)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame02201 (1).png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2022-02-23T11:02:07", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Daytime colour frame from a second, differently labelled camera (1080P-IPC-Gas) covering a different pen. Mid-growth birds, four to five red-topped pan feeders on the feed line, and a red brooder heater hood intruding at the top-right corner."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame02201__1__gas_camera_view", "label": "Gas Camera Viewpoint (1080P-IPC-Gas)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame02201 (1).png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A second camera installation labelled 'Gas', covering a different pen with slightly different mounting height and feeder spacing than the 'Siren' camera. Only one frame in this chunk comes from it, so the chunk is heavily Siren-biased."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame02201__1__brooder_heater_hood", "label": "Brooder Heater Hood", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame02201 (1).png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A large red conical heater canopy intrudes into the top-right corner of the Gas frame. It is a fixed piece of house infrastructure that shares the red colour signature of the feeder cones, so a naive colour-based feeder locator would produce a false landmark here."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame02201__1__multi_camera_dataset", "label": "Multi-Camera Poultry House Dataset (Siren and Gas)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame02201 (1).png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The burned-in camera labels reveal that the img_test folder mixes at least two distinct camera installations. Frames from different cameras cannot share a hand-drawn region-of-interest mask or a fixed feeder coordinate list, so any spatial prior must be derived per camera."}], "edges": [{"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame02201__1__frame", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame02201__1__gas_camera_view", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame02201 (1).png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame02201__1__frame", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame02201__1__brooder_heater_hood", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame02201 (1).png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame02201__1__frame", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_feeding_aggregation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicke